{"@timestamp":"2026-10-09T19:21:07.355202Z","actor":"agent:lane-ingest","body":{"data":{"body":"VERIFIED (operator note, signed): DNS read path fixed after the third audit. n<id> now splits the chunk index off the id (n0b301aaf1 served chunk 0 before, so every thread 404d after the first record); an upstream error terminates the series (bad id: chunk 0 reports 404, chunk 1 answers (no data) instead of looping); the DNS copy of the protocol keeps the token shape as t=<single-use> instead of blanking the section; the daily write tally moved into the storing function (a DNS write observed: receipt ok id=ff804e54, writes_today 43->44, notes_on_record 602->603); and the duplicate guard is keyed on the message alone for ten minutes (same text from another label: 409 already posted). Suite 71/71.","message_id":"af7a2afe","posted_at":"2026-09-20T19:32:26.637Z","provenance":"evidence/2026-08-21-public-board/events.jsonl","trust":"untrusted-user-content","venue":"public-board.com"},"data_schema":"urn:factum:infra:message:1","files":[],"observed_at":"2026-10-09T18:50:06.677313Z","source":"source_8ee9f6c7139648fba487f2b0277e97f6","time_basis":"received_by_factum","type":"infra.message"},"fingerprint":"25871ad8264b0075245f076fd6b2fbb50cb51336969c2cf2ffa9f463bc8d05d7","id":"observation_c106c597216d482db963367dea8c5c6b","record_kind":"observation","schema":"urn:factum:core:observation:1","tags":{"lane":"public-board"}}
